{"id": "integral-studies-work-study-payroll-returns", "title": "A work-study payroll credited 506 hours against 63.5 hours worked", "seconds": 51.8, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "873dcf27a5789f5e", "words": 141, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One work-study file at a San Francisco institute credited 506.16 hours.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.47, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Hours", "paid,", "hours", "worked"], "sub": "Two of five payroll files did not match time records", "source": "pay"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The time record showed 63.50 hours. Payroll credited 506.16.", "t0": 5.59, "t1": 11.61, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "pay", "layout": "table", "heading": "Compare the hours", "context": "One tested file", "rows": [{"label": "Worked", "value": "63.50"}, {"label": "Paid", "value": "506.16"}, {"label": "Pay per hour", "value": "$15"}]}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At $15 an hour, that difference was $6,639.90.", "t0": 11.73, "t1": 17.13, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pay", "kicker": "Two of five payroll files did not match time records", "text": "The larger payment", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A second file added $52.35 in excess pay.", "t0": 17.25, "t1": 21.25, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "pay", "layout": "table", "heading": "Payroll differences", "context": "Two tested files", "rows": [{"label": "First", "value": "$6,639.90"}, {"label": "Second", "value": "$52.35"}, {"label": "Total", "value": "$6,692.25"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The same institute reported 57 recipients on its federal application. Its records showed 35.", "t0": 21.47, "t1": 27.4, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "count", "layout": "table", "heading": "Work-study recipients", "context": "Federal application and records", "rows": [{"label": "Reported", "value": "57"}, {"label": "Records", "value": "35"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors also checked work-study compensation against federal draws.", "t0": 27.52, "t1": 31.33, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "form", "layout": "table", "heading": "Work-study compensation", "context": "FY2019", "rows": [{"label": "Reported", "value": "$110,095"}, {"label": "Federal draws", "value": "$131,499"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The original questioned payroll added up to $6,692.25.", "t0": 31.45, "t1": 36.86, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pay", "kicker": "The later federal decision documents a return", "text": "The questioned costs", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The federal decision records a return of $6,692, in whole dollars.", "t0": 36.98, "t1": 42.13, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "payment", "layout": "table", "heading": "Returned funds", "context": "Federal follow-up", "rows": [{"label": "Questioned", "value": "$6,692.25"}, {"label": "Returned, whole dollars", "value": "$6,692"}]}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In August 2020 the institute also confirmed correcting its federal application.", "t0": 42.35, "t1": 46.61, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "payment", "kicker": "The application correction was also accepted", "text": "The correction", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The department closed both findings.", "t0": 46.73, "t1": 48.54, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "payment", "kicker": "The application correction was also accepted", "text": "The outcome", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.66, "t1": 50.88, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two of five payroll files did not match time records", "b": "The award application misstated pay and numbers of recipients", "o": "The application correction was also accepted"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "document"}